## Erlang VM settings of the Sky server (used by "rebar3 as prod release"; see "Scaling" in README.md)

## the name of the node and its secret. Change the cookie (any long random text); keep it private.
-sname sky
-setcookie CHANGE_THIS_TO_A_LONG_RANDOM_TEXT

## how many Erlang processes and ports (connections) the VM may have. The defaults (262144 / 65536) are too small for 100 000 phones.
+P 4194304
+Q 1048576

## a bigger buffer between nodes and for busy sockets
+zdbbl 131072

## the node listens for its own console only on this machine
-kernel inet_dist_use_interface "{127,0,0,1}"

## do not wait busily when idle (saves CPU for the phones' batteries... and the electricity bill)
+sbwt none
+sbwtdcpu none
+sbwtdio none
